+"""Tests for Exp 4959 deep ARC level-up attempt.
+
+Spec refs: REQ-CAPSTONE-4959, SCENARIO-CAPSTONE-4959,
+SCENARIO-CAPSTONE-4959-BLOCKED-PRECONDITION,
+SCENARIO-CAPSTONE-4959-FIELD-PRINCIPLES.
